{
  "name": "Email AI pictures to people who fill in a form, with Treza and Gmail",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "319b9948-e3d4-54f2-8a82-7be16c2fafba",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 460,
        "height": 760,
        "content": "## Pictures from form replies, sent by email\nShare a form that asks what picture someone wants. Each reply becomes an AI image, and the person gets it in their inbox as an attachment a few seconds later. Useful for giveaways, event booths, lead magnets and classroom activities.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Picture request form** collects an email address, a description and a style.\n2. **Settings** holds the shape, the spend cap and the email text.\n3. **Make the picture** gets a quote, stops if it is over **Max Cost**, renders the image and downloads it.\n4. **Email the picture** sends it from your Gmail with the image attached.\n\n### Setup\n1. Add your Treza API credential to **Make the picture**.\n2. Connect your Google account in **Email the picture**.\n3. Activate the workflow and open the form's Production URL.\n\n### Customization\nEdit the styles in the form, change the shape or the email wording in **Settings**, or swap Gmail for Outlook or Send Email. Keep **Max Cost** low on a public form, since every reply spends credits.\n\n### Requirements\n- The verified community node **Treza** (`@treza/n8n-nodes-treza`, tested with 0.1.3 on n8n 2.46.6). On n8n Cloud, search for Treza in the nodes panel. Self-hosted: Settings > Community Nodes. Guide: https://www.trezalabs.com/integrations/n8n\n- A Treza API key from https://www.trezalabs.com/platform/api-keys with the pipelines:read, pipelines:write and pipelines:run permissions, saved as a **Treza API** credential."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "283fab0d-797f-5733-8768-bf2a0c7e49af",
      "name": "Note: ask",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 460,
        "height": 420,
        "content": "## 1. Ask\nThe form asks for an email address, what to show and a style. **Settings** holds the shape, spend cap and email text.",
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8834309d-01b5-5e7b-a089-43f700c95884",
      "name": "Note: make",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        -140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 300,
        "height": 420,
        "content": "## 2. Make the picture\nTreza quotes the image first and stops if it costs more than Max Cost.",
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "61a66eda-7437-57b7-b867-d31ac7123a96",
      "name": "Note: send",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        760,
        -140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 300,
        "height": 420,
        "content": "## 3. Send it\nThe image goes out as an attachment from your Gmail.",
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "60958aeb-95ed-5c8e-9723-457123cbb85f",
      "name": "Picture request form",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        0,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Get a picture made for you",
        "formDescription": "Describe a picture and we'll email it to you in a minute.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Email",
              "fieldType": "email",
              "placeholder": "you@example.com",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "What should the picture show?",
              "fieldType": "textarea",
              "placeholder": "A lighthouse on a cliff during a thunderstorm",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Style",
              "fieldType": "dropdown",
              "fieldOptions": {
                "values": [
                  {
                    "option": "Photo"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "Illustration"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "Watercolor"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "3D render"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {
          "respondWithOptions": {
            "values": {
              "formSubmittedText": "Thanks! Your picture is on its way to your inbox."
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "webhookId": "cd2bd2da-4ae2-56dc-b749-672523e640bb"
    },
    {
      "id": "1f4086c4-72c7-58bc-94b1-c3418aa9fa59",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "286ef4d8-0530-5ab2-bf0d-b743a0ca3e88",
              "name": "aspectRatio",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "1:1"
            },
            {
              "id": "4f50fca4-0334-51e3-a9aa-333e00406a70",
              "name": "maxCostUsd",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 0.25
            },
            {
              "id": "777bf13f-e730-5a5e-b01b-e477f7e76616",
              "name": "emailSubject",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Your picture is ready"
            },
            {
              "id": "e53a477e-0f76-5651-801f-dd5a98f6570a",
              "name": "emailBody",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Here is the picture you asked for. Thanks for trying it!"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {},
        "includeOtherFields": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e85f17cc-f467-559f-8d7d-dca463d2f9e4",
      "name": "Make the picture",
      "type": "@treza/n8n-nodes-treza.treza",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        500,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "image",
        "operation": "generate",
        "prompt": "={{ $json['What should the picture show?'] }}, {{ $json.Style.toLowerCase() }} style",
        "maxCostUsd": "={{ $json.maxCostUsd }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "aspectRatio": "={{ $json.aspectRatio }}"
        },
        "download": true,
        "binaryPropertyName": "picture"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "80a2f9de-b5ec-5ebd-ac2b-1f4cf0b4de81",
      "name": "Email the picture",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        820,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Picture request form').item.json.Email }}",
        "subject": "={{ $('Settings').item.json.emailSubject }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ $('Settings').item.json.emailBody }}",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false,
          "attachmentsUi": {
            "attachmentsBinary": [
              {
                "property": "picture"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "webhookId": "17553a14-cfa3-5043-a0b4-edc75793bb6e"
    }
  ],
